{"nodes": [{"id": "theory_09_bet_check_bet_01_guideline_bet_check_bet", "label": "Bet Check Bet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/09-BET-CHECK-BET/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Linha BET FLOP \u2192 CHECK TURN \u2192 BET RIVER, baseada em ranges capados."}, {"id": "theory_09_bet_check_bet_01_guideline_range_capado", "label": "Range Capado", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/09-BET-CHECK-BET/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "BTN ap\u00f3s bet-check perde m\u00e3os fortes; BB ap\u00f3s check river tamb\u00e9m chega capado."}, {"id": "theory_09_bet_check_bet_01_guideline_principio_bluffs", "label": "Princ\u00edpio dos Bluffs: definir o alvo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "theory/09-BET-CHECK-BET/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Qual m\u00e3o queremos fazer foldar? Minha m\u00e3o bloqueia essa m\u00e3o? Nunca blefar apenas porque a m\u00e3o \u00e9 fraca."}, {"id": "theory_09_bet_check_bet_01_guideline_blocker_depende_alvo", "label": "Blocker Depende do Alvo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "theory/09-BET-CHECK-BET/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Se o alvo \u00e9 Ax, evitar blefar Ax; se o alvo \u00e9 Kx, evitar Kx."}, {"id": "theory_09_bet_check_bet_01_guideline_river_blank", "label": "River Blank (B70)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/09-BET-CHECK-BET/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Value: melhor terceiro par, second pair+; Bluff: Qx ou pior, atacando Ax."}, {"id": "theory_09_bet_check_bet_01_guideli